<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Facture &amp; Attestations CE — {{ foyer.nom }} — Studio Danse 430</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #b8860b;
            --ink: #111;
            --muted: #555;
            --line: #ddd;
            --bg: #f7f7f5;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: var(--bg);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
        .toolbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: #fff;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #FFD700;
        }
        .toolbar a, .toolbar button {
            appearance: none;
            border: 1px solid #FFD700;
            background: #FFD700;
            color: #000;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.4rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .toolbar a.secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: #FFD700;
        }
        .sheet {
            width: 210mm;
            max-width: 100%;
            margin: 1.5rem auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 18mm 16mm;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
        }
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #FFD700;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.9rem;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .brand img {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .brand h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .brand p { margin: 0.15rem 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .doc-meta { text-align: right; }
        .doc-meta .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #111;
            color: #FFD700;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
            border-radius: 0.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            background: #fafafa;
        }
        .card h2 {
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: var(--gold);
        }
        .card strong { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
        }
        th, td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding: 0.55rem 0.4rem;
            text-align: left;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        th {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--muted);
            border-bottom: 2px solid #FFD700;
        }
        td.num, th.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
        .totals {
            margin-left: auto;
            width: min(360px, 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .totals .row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .totals .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
        .totals .row.total {
            background: #111;
            color: #FFD700;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .muted { color: var(--muted); }
        .footnote {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding-top: 0.75rem;
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        .signature-block {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: end;
        }
        .signature-box {
            border: 1px dashed var(--line);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            min-height: 90px;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        }
        .signature-box h3 {
            margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        .page-break { page-break-after: always; }
        @media print {
            body { background: #fff; }
            .no-print { display: none !important; }
            .sheet {
                margin: 0;
                width: 100%;
                box-shadow: none;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .page-break { page-break-after: always; break-after: page; }
            a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
        }
        @page { size: A4; margin: 12mm; }
        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .sheet { margin: 0; padding: 1.25rem; }
            .grid-2, .signature-block, .header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; display: grid; }
            .doc-meta { text-align: left; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="toolbar no-print">
        <div>
            <a href="{{ path('app_foyer_index') }}" class="secondary">← Retour au foyer</a>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <button type="button" onclick="window.print()">🖨 Imprimer / Enregistrer en PDF</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    {% for page in pagesDanseurs %}
        {% set danseur = page.danseur %}
        <article class="sheet">
            <header class="header">
                <div class="brand">
                    <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('images/logo.studio-danse-430.jpg')) }}" alt="Logo Studio Danse 430">
                    <div>
                        <h1>{{ association.nom }}</h1>
                        <p>{{ association.adresse }}</p>
                        <p>{{ association.codePostal }} {{ association.ville }}</p>
                        <p>{{ association.email }}</p>
                        <p>SIRET : {{ association.siret }} · RNA : {{ association.rna }}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-meta">
                    <div class="badge">Attestation CE</div>
                    <p><strong>N° {{ numeroDocument }}-{{ loop.index }}</strong></p>
                    <p class="muted">Émis le {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                    <p class="muted">Saison {{ saison }}</p>
                </div>
            </header>

            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Élève</h2>
                    <strong>{{ danseur.prenom }} {{ danseur.nom }}</strong>
                    {% if danseur.dateNaissance %}
                        <p class="muted">Né(e) le {{ danseur.dateNaissance|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Foyer</h2>
                    <strong>{{ foyer.nom }}</strong>
                    <p>{{ foyer.adresse }}</p>
                    <p>{{ foyer.codePostal }} {{ foyer.ville }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="section-title">Cours — Saison {{ saison }}</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Cours</th>
                        <th>Jour / Horaire</th>
                        <th class="num">Tarif de base</th>
                        <th>Remise appliquée</th>
                        <th class="num">Montant net</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for cours in page.cours %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ cours.coursNom }}</td>
                            <td class="muted">{{ cours.jour }} · {{ cours.horaire }}</td>
                            <td class="num">{{ cours.tarifBrut|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                            <td>
                                {% if cours.remises is not empty %}
                                    {% for r in cours.remises %}
                                        <span class="muted">{{ r }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                                    {% endfor %}
                                {% else %}
                                    <span class="muted">—</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td class="num"><strong>{{ cours.montantNet|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</strong></td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="totals">
                <div class="row total">
                    <span>Total net — {{ danseur.prenom }}</span>
                    <span>{{ page.totalNet|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="signature-block">
                <div>
                    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.8rem; line-height:1.55; margin:0;">
                        <em>Attestation de paiement délivrée pour valoir ce que de droit
                        (Comité d’Entreprise / Aides).</em>
                    </p>
                    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">
                        Fait à {{ association.ville }}, le {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y') }}.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="signature-box">
                    <h3>Signature / Cachet du bureau</h3>
                    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Studio Danse 430</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <footer class="footnote">
                <p>
                    Association {{ association.nom }} — {{ association.adresse }},
                    {{ association.codePostal }} {{ association.ville }}.
                </p>
            </footer>
        </article>
        <div class="page-break"></div>
    {% else %}
        <article class="sheet">
            <p class="muted">Aucun danseur inscrit pour la saison {{ saison }}.</p>
        </article>
        <div class="page-break"></div>
    {% endfor %}

    {# ===== PAGE FINALE : Récapitulatif foyer ===== #}
    <article class="sheet">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="brand">
                <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('images/logo.studio-danse-430.jpg')) }}" alt="Logo Studio Danse 430">
                <div>
                    <h1>{{ association.nom }}</h1>
                    <p>{{ association.adresse }}</p>
                    <p>{{ association.codePostal }} {{ association.ville }}</p>
                    <p>{{ association.email }}</p>
                    <p>SIRET : {{ association.siret }} · RNA : {{ association.rna }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="doc-meta">
                <div class="badge">Récapitulatif foyer</div>
                <p><strong>N° {{ numeroDocument }}</strong></p>
                <p class="muted">Émis le {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                <p class="muted">Saison {{ saison }}</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <h2 style="margin:0 0 1rem; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--gold);">
            Récapitulatif Financier du Foyer {{ foyer.nom }} — Saison {{ saison }}
        </h2>

        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
            <h2>Foyer</h2>
            <strong>{{ foyer.nom }}</strong>
            <p>{{ foyer.adresse }}</p>
            <p>{{ foyer.codePostal }} {{ foyer.ville }}</p>
            {% if responsable %}
                <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
                    Responsable : {{ responsable.email }}
                    {% if responsable.telephone %}<br>Tél. {{ responsable.telephone }}{% endif %}
                </p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">Détail synthétique</h2>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Danseur</th>
                    <th>Cours</th>
                    <th class="num">Montant net</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for ligne in lignesRecap %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ ligne.danseurNom }}</td>
                        <td>{{ ligne.coursNom }}</td>
                        <td class="num">{{ ligne.montantNet|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    </tr>
                {% else %}
                    <tr><td colspan="3" class="muted">Aucune ligne tarifaire.</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="totals">
            <div class="row">
                <span>Sous-total brut (cours)</span>
                <span>{{ cotisation.subtotal|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
            </div>
            {% if cotisation.gratuit2020Amount > 0 %}
                <div class="row">
                    <span>Gratuité enfants nés en 2020</span>
                    <span>− {{ cotisation.gratuit2020Amount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if cotisation.foyerDiscountPercentage > 0 %}
                <div class="row">
                    <span>Remise fratrie (−{{ cotisation.foyerDiscountPercentage }} %)</span>
                    <span>− {{ cotisation.foyerDiscountAmount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if cotisation.remiseManuelleAmount > 0 %}
                <div class="row">
                    <span>
                        Remise bureau (manuelle)
                        {% if cotisation.motifRemise %}<br><span class="muted">{{ cotisation.motifRemise }}</span>{% endif %}
                    </span>
                    <span>− {{ cotisation.remiseManuelleAmount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="row total">
                <span>Total général du foyer</span>
                <span>{{ cotisation.total|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row total">
                <span>Montant total règlementé par la famille</span>
                <span>{{ cotisation.grandTotal|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-block">
            <div>
                <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.8rem; line-height:1.55; margin:0;">
                    <em>Attestation de paiement délivrée pour valoir ce que de droit
                    (Comité d’Entreprise / Aides).</em>
                </p>
                <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">
                    Fait à {{ association.ville }}, le {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y') }}.
                </p>
                <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.5rem; font-size:0.75rem;">
                    Document sans détail d’échéancier ni numéros de chèques.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-box">
                <h3>Signature / Cachet du bureau</h3>
                <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Studio Danse 430</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="footnote">
            <p>
                Association {{ association.nom }} — {{ association.adresse }},
                {{ association.codePostal }} {{ association.ville }}.
                Conservez ce document pour vos dossiers CE / aides.
            </p>
        </footer>
    </article>
</body>
</html>
